 About the Role: 
 This role&nbsp;sits in the Product team of&nbsp;our&nbsp;Digital Building System &amp; Planning&nbsp;(DBSP)&nbsp;vertical, whose function is to provide the&nbsp;essential&nbsp;link&nbsp;in our digital value chain&nbsp;between our physical building&nbsp;planning teams and our&nbsp;product delivery&nbsp;and execution&nbsp;teams, who&nbsp;coordinate&nbsp;the automated production and site assembly of our projects. &nbsp; 
 As a Product Manager on this team, you will&nbsp;help drive the development of the&nbsp;key&nbsp;digital products which&nbsp;define our building system and enable its&nbsp;scalable&nbsp;application to our growing number of building projects. &nbsp; 
