 Manage and coordinate&nbsp;the development of the GROPYUS&nbsp;digital&nbsp;products that&nbsp;enable&nbsp;fast and efficient&nbsp;building&nbsp;product design and project&nbsp;planning across&nbsp;the digital value chain &nbsp; 
